              "subject": "Retro pixel-art style used car lot at night with neon sign reading REVVLOT and rows of cars under string lights",
              "purpose": "Hero visual that sets the nostalgic 90s tone and makes the brand instantly memorable",
              "quantity": 1,
              "used_by": [
                "home-section-1"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "home-section-2",
          "type": "stats",
